   "src": "L8433-8436",
   "text": "An Isolan storyteller and a player-tribe devotee recite accounts of the same historical event. The dates and heroes differ. A famously merciless keeper of verses corrects both, then accidentally misquotes a sacred line and becomes the laughingstock of the festival.",
   "name": "Who Gets to Tell Isola's History?",
